--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON THIS FORK / 关于本派生项目
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is an unofficial Android port ("fork") of the upstream project
https://github.com/fish2018/pansou , licensed under the MIT License above.

Portions newly written for this port — the Android Java shell, local HTTP
server / proxy, build script, and the pansou-native.js injection layer — are
also released under the MIT License. Copyright (c) 2026 lizy2020.

All upstream Go backend source, plugins, configuration, web frontend assets,
and the compiled backend binary remain the property of their original authors
and are redistributed here under the upstream MIT License. See NOTICE.md for
full provenance and the non-commercial request from the upstream author.
